e mark of being anything above average. Certain set pieces help rectify these issues, and there really isn't much to complain about. The story does its job. The music was average to pretty good. Sometimes it stuck out very well and complemented the action, but for the most part, it was forgettable. A very solid game that does just about everything well, but only excels in presentation, style, and gameplay—looking forward to playing the sequel. Also, I played it on my Steam Deck and it runs flawlessly at max settings.", "timestamp_created": 1690814822, "timestamp_updated": 1690814883, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143127915", "author": {"steamid": "76561198993268192", "personaname": "Speshy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198993268192/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 118, "playtime_forever": 449, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 449, "last_played": 1690783034, "avatar": "59a9b9f252b918e5b01d483d8c6ad02265f2d6c9"}, "language": "english", "review": "I grew hair on my chest after this", "timestamp_created": 1690783050, "timestamp_updated": 1690783050, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143125378", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091490198", "personaname": "Grimwalker", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091490198/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 65, "playtime_forever": 712, "playtime